<title>SWEDEN: Sweden announces limited cabinet changes.</title>
<headline>Sweden announces limited cabinet changes.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's government on Tuesday announced limited cabinet changes, with Defence Minister Thage Peterson moving to the &quot;inner cabinet&quot;, the prime minister's closest group of advisors.</p>
<p>He is replaced as defence minister by Bjorn Von Sydow, previously industry and commerce minister.</p>
